{
  "comment": "Regression query set for the browse search harness (scripts/search-eval.mjs). mustInclude entries are case-insensitive substrings matched against item names; every entry must appear somewhere in the final results. topOne is a list of acceptable #1 results. topThree entries must all appear in the first three results. Update expectations when the catalog changes materially.",
